      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "PAW NILBERT (8) scored two back in one of the fastest times of the program when on speed but last start drifted back and wound up strongly to finish a 8 length third at this track (25.63). Makes plenty of appeal. STIDHAM KANSAS (1) scored an on-pace win two back then gave a start and could manage only 8th at The Meadows (31.21) last time. Was a winner at her only start from this draw. Should be about the money. APTITUDE (7) turned in a plain effort last time when seventh at Geelong over 460m behind Paw Kabuto (26.94) in a Mix 6/7. Was in the money the start prior. Will give the top chances plenty to think about. XARA'S JAI (2) will run well despite no experience on this trip.",
